{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03877","headline":"弘农清岩曲有磐石可坐宋十一每拂拭待余寄诗赠之 · 田游岩","name":"弘农清岩曲有磐石可坐宋十一每拂拭待余寄诗赠之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"信彼称灵石，居然狎遁栖。\n裴回承翠巘，斌驳带深谿。\n夕阴起层岫，清景半虹霓。\n风来应啸阮，波动可琴嵇。\n仆也颍阳客，望彼空思齐。\n傥见山人至，簪嵩且杖藜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"田游岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03877.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03877","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}